WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:02.030
The side that never faces us.

00:02.803 --> 00:08.357
From here the Earth is always below the horizon, so the Moon itself blocks any radio link home.

00:08.852 --> 00:14.977
China first put a relay satellite, Queqiao, out beyond the Moon, and the lander spoke to Earth through it.

00:15.561 --> 00:19.325
Its rover, Yutu 2, was still driving four years later.
